### LankaEats API walkthrough (VS Code REST Client / Rider / Visual Studio)
@gateway = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Get a demo token (customer)
# @name login
POST {{gateway}}/auth/demo-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Nimal", "role": "customer" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### 2. Browse the menu (anonymous, served from Redis-backed HybridCache)
GET {{gateway}}/api/menu

### 3. Place an order (card) -> Pending -> StockReserved -> Confirmed
# @name order
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryAddress": "42 Galle Road, Colombo 03",
  "paymentMethod": "card",
  "items": [
    { "menuItemId": "0199a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000001", "quantity": 2 },
    { "menuItemId": "0199a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000007", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### 4. Check the order (repeat to watch the status change)
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Payment record
GET {{gateway}}/api/payments/{{order.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Compensation path: declined card -> Rejected, stock released
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryAddress": "Kandy",
  "paymentMethod": "test_declined_card",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": "0199a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000006", "quantity": 3 }]
}

### 7. Sold out path: only 5 Fish Ambul Thiyal in stock
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deliveryAddress": "Galle Fort",
  "paymentMethod": "card",
  "items": [{ "menuItemId": "0199a000-0000-7000-8000-000000000006", "quantity": 6 }]
}

### 8. My orders
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Admin token
# @name admin
POST {{gateway}}/auth/demo-token
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Kitchen", "role": "admin" }

### 10. Advance an order: Confirmed -> Preparing -> OutForDelivery -> Delivered
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.id}}/advance
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.accessToken}}
